{"4297130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Worst Wifey (ワル嫁)", "steam_appid": 4297130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worst Wifey is a desktop companion you can spend time with on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with her to see different reactions. Ignore her for too long and she might not be very happy. Treat her well and play around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297130/extras/45e70777c8b481316b4b6ed3cf05fb58.poster.avif?t=1776337156\" width=200 height=361 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297130/extras/45e70777c8b481316b4b6ed3cf05fb58.webm?t=1776337156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Interactions: Drag, push, and play with your companion directly on your screen.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics: place her on your windows or drop her to your taskbar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on her to make her happy: she gets sad if you don’t pay attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She gazes at your mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And dancing!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297130/extras/59e3d72aa0fd14c157e62b099c65afed.poster.avif?t=1776337156\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297130/extras/59e3d72aa0fd14c157e62b099c65afed.webm?t=1776337156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297130/extras/59e3d72aa0fd14c157e62b099c65afed.mp4?t=1776337156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More About Your New Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's not just sitting there waiting, Her fully physics-driven body means every interaction feels dynamic and unpredictable. Fling her across your screen, watch her tumble off your browser window, or gently set her down on your taskbar. She'll react to it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mood System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companion has feelings! Her mood shifts based on how you treat her:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happy:</strong> Click on her, play with her, give her attention, she'll light up, dance, and generally be delightful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neglected:</strong> Ignore her too long and she'll notice. Expect sulking, sad expressions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic:</strong> Yeet her around too much? She might have opinions about that too</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her emotional state affects her animations, expressions, and how she responds to your interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Desktop Integration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She lives <i>on</i> your desktop, not in a window. Drag her onto your actual application windows. Drop her. Watch physics do its thing. She'll collide with your taskbar, rest on your browser, and generally make your workspace more chaotic (affectionately).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worst Wifey is a desktop companion you can spend time with on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with her to see different reactions. Ignore her for too long and she might not be very happy. Treat her well and play around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297130/extras/45e70777c8b481316b4b6ed3cf05fb58.poster.avif?t=1776337156\" width=200 height=361 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297130/extras/45e70777c8b481316b4b6ed3cf05fb58.webm?t=1776337156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Interactions: Drag, push, and play with your companion directly on your screen.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics: place her on your windows or drop her to your taskbar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on her to make her happy: she gets sad if you don’t pay attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She gazes at your mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And dancing!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297130/extras/59e3d72aa0fd14c157e62b099c65afed.poster.avif?t=1776337156\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297130/extras/59e3d72aa0fd14c157e62b099c65afed.webm?t=1776337156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297130/extras/59e3d72aa0fd14c157e62b099c65afed.mp4?t=1776337156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More About Your New Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's not just sitting there waiting, Her fully physics-driven body means every interaction feels dynamic and unpredictable. Fling her across your screen, watch her tumble off your browser window, or gently set her down on your taskbar. She'll react to it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mood System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companion has feelings! Her mood shifts based on how you treat her:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happy:</strong> Click on her, play with her, give her attention, she'll light up, dance, and generally be delightful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neglected:</strong> Ignore her too long and she'll notice. Expect sulking, sad expressions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic:</strong> Yeet her around too much? She might have opinions about that too</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her emotional state affects her animations, expressions, and how she responds to your interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Desktop Integration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She lives <i>on</i> your desktop, not in a window. Drag her onto your actual application windows. Drop her. Watch physics do its thing. She'll collide with your taskbar, rest on your browser, and generally make your workspace more chaotic (affectionately).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Feeling like your desktop is a little too lonely? A cute desktop companion baddie to keep you company and brighten your screen. with EXTRA PHYSICS!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297130/b3c248989f6573c09191a14c3df3e16e7632e6c4/header.jpg?t=1776337156", "capsule_image